# Canvas UI

Read `.agents/skills/canvas-ui/SKILL.md` before wrapping UI in Liquid, Bend, or other `@canvas-ui` effects.

- Installed: `src/components/canvasui/Liquid.tsx`, `Bend.tsx`
- Add: `cmd.exe /c "npx --yes shadcn@latest add @canvas-ui/<name>-react -y"`
- Effects only. Keep `DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` / `src/styles/tokens.css`. This is not a shadcn/ui kit swap.
